#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_height.rst:5
msgid "Row height definition"
msgstr "行高定义"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_height.rst:7
msgid ""
"The height from a `row`_ can only be defined from row head, the left cell "
"which is given the height value from the corresponding `row`_ . The head "
"from the `row`_ is not displayed at `folio`_, it is only displayed at `title"
" block editor`_."
msgstr ""
"`行 <row_>`_ 的高度只能通过行头定义，即左侧的单元格，它表示相应 `行 <row_>`_ 的高度值。`行 <row_>`_ 的行头不会显示在 "
"`图幅 <folio_>`_ 中，仅在 `图框编辑器 <title block editor_>`_ 中显示。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_height.rst:14
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Title block"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_height.rst:17
msgid "Double click on row head to display the row height PopUp window."
msgstr "双击行头可显示行高弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_height.rst:22
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Title block row height PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框行高弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_height.rst:25
msgid "Define the height value in pixels."
msgstr "以像素为单位定义高度值。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_height.rst:27
msgid "Press **OK**."
msgstr "按 **确定** 。"
